  "notes": "RTINGS reviews exist for FO32U2P, PG32UCDM (and Gen3), 321URX, 32GS95UE, G80SD and AW3225QF but pages are JS-rendered/blocked for the fetch tool, so no RTINGS numbers were recorded. No independent lab review found for MO32U2, MO32U24, AORUS FO32U2, AORUS ELITE FO32U24G or MO27U2; no TFTCentral/TechSpot review of FO32U2P found. Measurement methods differ: Tom's Hardware input lag (18-25ms) is end-to-end click-to-photon, TFTCentral/TechSpot (<0.5ms) is display processing lag only - do not mix. Tom's HDR peak is 25% window; TechSpot/TFTCentral quote 10%/2%. Market has moved on: TechSpot's June 2026 OLED guide names ASUS XG32UCWMG (Tandem WOLED), MSI 321UPX, Samsung G81SF as current picks; ASUS PG32UCDP (WOLED dual-mode 480Hz) also exists. FO32U2P's differentiator vs most rivals: full DP 2.1 UHBR20 + KVM + speakers; only PG32UCDM3 matches DP 2.1 among listed rivals."
